SYNTHESIS
  The two support notions are not the same.  Schur/additive triangles are
  a Fourier relation-support proxy; odd/even W_j is the factorial-origin
  support after miss-zeta inversion.  In this bank, odd_share is not a
  monotone function of cross-Schur counts, so HYP-2720 should not replace
  HYP-2719.  The useful split is sequential: HYP-2719 selects low-support
  carrier packets; HYP-2720 taxes their origin atom in factorial parity.
